OL,3,GNEWSAHappy GCSE wait is over, says
OL,4,Aaspiring teacher
OL,5,
OL,6,FStudents at schools and colleges across
OL,7,FJersey and Guernsey are receiving their
OL,8,FGCSE results.
OL,10,FSchools handed out results from 08:00
OL,11,FBST with staff on hand to congratulate
OL,12,Fpupils and offer guidance to anyone who
OL,13,Fmight have been disappointed.
OL,15,FCareers advisers on both islands were
OL,16,Falso available to help students plan
OL,17,Ftheir next steps.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
